# Conditional Statements & Decision Making

##  Overview

On Day 3 of my **Python Programming Portfolio**, I learned how to use conditional statements to make decisions in Python programs.

Conditional statements allow a program to execute different blocks of code depending on whether a condition is `True` or `False`.

