# 🚀 Mini Project – Number Classification

This mini project combines multiple conditional concepts to classify a number.

```python
number = int(input("Enter a number: "))

if number > 0:
    print("Positive number")

    if number % 2 == 0:
        print("It is even")
    else:
        print("It is odd")

elif number < 0:
    print("Negative number")
else:
    print("The number is zero")
```

### Example Output

```text
Enter a number: 25
Positive number
It is odd
```

